{% comment %}
  OPAL LINE — Product Details / Price Breakup (standalone section)
  ==============================================================
  Thin wrapper around snippets/opal-product-details.liquid (the actual UI).

  Two ways to use:
    1. STANDALONE SECTION (JSON-template themes, Dawn 12+):
       Online Store > Customize > switch to a product page > Add section
       > "Product Details / Price Breakup".
    2. BLOCK inside main-product.liquid (Liquid-template themes):
       Paste the block schema below into the "blocks" array of
       sections/main-product.liquid, and add the render case in its block
       loop:
         {%- case block.type -%}
           {%- when 'opal_details' -%}
             {% render 'opal-product-details' %}
         {%- endcase -%}
{% endcomment %}

{% render 'opal-product-details' %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Product Details / Price Breakup",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Product Details / Price Breakup"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}